# 📊 Advanced Excel Power Query Automation – Day 2

## 🚀 Project Overview
This project demonstrates how to automate the consolidation of multiple daily Excel files using Power Query in Excel.

The solution dynamically combines files from a folder, cleans the data, and enables one-click refresh when new files are added.

---

## 🎯 Key Objectives
- Automate daily file consolidation
- Perform real-world data cleaning
- Apply correct data types
- Enable scalable refresh mechanism

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Power Query
- Folder-based automation

---

## ⚙️ Key Features
✅ Folder-based file ingestion  
✅ Automatic file combination  
✅ Trim & Clean transformations  
✅ Data type standardization  
✅ One-click Refresh All  
✅ Source file tracking  

